": "Generaliza construirPodio de TopViewModel a cualquier metrica entera (asistencia, tiempo, racha): un solo sistema de comparacion reutilizado, empates comparten puesto."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_26_resumen_cliente_video_design_diafavoritoenrango", "label": "diaFavoritoEnRango", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-26-resumen-cliente-video-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Como RachaCalculator.diaFavorito pero con desempate aleatorio real y devolviendo el nombre del dia en vez del indice."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_26_resumen_cliente_video_design_leyendaporpuesto", "label": "leyendaPorPuesto", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-26-resumen-cliente-video-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_26_resumen_cliente_video_design_tarjetaresumen", "label": "TarjetaResumen", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-26-resumen-cliente-video-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_26_resumen_cliente_video_design_resumencardrenderer", "label": "ResumenCardRenderer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-26-resumen-cliente-video-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dibuja con Canvas/Paint nativos y deliberadamente sin Compose: asi corre en una coroutine de fondo sin vista adjunta y el bitmap intermedio se puede guardar como PNG para verificar."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_26_resumen_cliente_video_design_resumenvideoencoder", "label": "ResumenVideoEncoder", "file_type": "concept", "source_file":